join Daemon center [animation="Bounce In"]
Daemon: Well, well… look who crawled back from the vacuum.\
My favorite little Astro Raider. The one who owes me… let me check…\
ONE MILLION Galactic Credits.
Daemon: Don’t look so confused. Yes, I revived you. Again.\
You die more often than my patience does.
Daemon: Now listen carefully, little space-slug.\
Normally I wouldn’t waste a single cosmic heartbeat teaching someone like you.
Daemon: But until you pay off your debt, YOU are technically MY property.
Daemon: And I don’t like my property exploding uselessly in deep space.\
So… I will show you how to fly, shoot and survive
Daemon: just enough to keep you alive long enough to PAY ME BACK.
Daemon: Now. Since your tiny mortal brain keeps forgetting the basics,\
let’s try something SIMPLE.
Daemon: See that suit you’re wearing?\
That’s a Gravitic Mobility Suit.\
A marvel of cosmic engineering… completely wasted on you.\
It bends local gravity around you.
Daemon: Meaning, wherever you press, you FLOAT.\
Mind-blowing, I know.
Daemon: So try it.\
Press [b][color=gold]W A S D[/color][/b] to move your pathetic body around.
[signal arg="wait_for_wasd_input"]
